# Ship to production

When a change is meant for the live product, commit it and get it onto `main`. Do not wait for a separate "please push" message.

Production is Vercel from `main` (`https://xoopa.app` and `https://vibelaunch-nu.vercel.app`). Feature-branch pushes do not update production.

- Commit with a concise message focused on why.
- Push the branch and open or update a PR if needed.
- `cursor/*` PRs auto-merge to `main` after the Vercel check passes. Use that path when already on a `cursor/*` branch.
- Confirm production has the new commit before telling the user it is live.
- Do not force-push `main`.
